# 静态资源长效缓存：图片/字体/音频体积大且版本化，缓存1天，分享后二次访问秒开
/public/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800

/public/textures/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800

/public/clue-backgrounds/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800

/public/hero/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800

/public/anchors/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800

/public/mascots/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800

/public/audio/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800

/public/vendor/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800

# HTML/JS/CSS 保持即时刷新，确保代码更新立即生效
/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
